OL,3,ASupreme Court hears church warden
OL,4,Amurder appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former deputy church warden could not
OL,7,Fhave have legally caused a university
OL,8,Flecturer's death by giving him
OL,9,Fpotentially sedated whisky, the Supreme
OL,10,FCourt has been told.
OL,12,FBenjamin Field, 35, was jailed for at
OL,13,Fleast 36 years in 2019 after being
OL,14,Ffound guilty of murdering 69-year-old
OL,15,FPeter Farquhar in Maids Moreton,
OL,16,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,18,FIn April, appeal judges quashed Field's
OL,19,Fconviction and ordered a retrial, but
OL,20,Fsaid the Crown Prosecution Service
OL,21,F(CPS) could take the case to the
OL,22,FSupreme Court first.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
