OL,3,ASupreme Court hears church warden
OL,4,Amurder appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd on Tuesday, five justices at the
OL,7,FUK's highest court were asked to
OL,8,Fconsider whether Field could have made
OL,9,FMr Farquhar cause his own death without
OL,10,FField legally being responsible.
